#. Tag: para
#: configuring.docbook:1460 configuring.docbook:1491
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note: Deprecated since &kde; 4.10. Please use <link linkend=\"variable-"
"remove-trailing-spaces\"> remove-trailing-spaces</link> with the desired "
